ested in comprehensively reforming the tax code to address cryptocurrency and digital assets, yet no agreement has been reached. \tDigital assets are a new technology with a multitude of use cases. Several commonsense tax solutions taken together would reduce burdens, increase compliance, and protect revenue.   Executive Summary  As digi, Author(s): Debbie Jennings"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},